        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Shadows Wake Me\n- People: Damhnait Doyle, Ken Myhr, Jane Siberry\n- Companies: Latitude Records, EMI Music Canada\n- Organizations: Cowboy Junkies\n- Topics: Canadian music\n\nFacts:\n- Shadows Wake Me is the first studio album by Canadian singer Damhnait Doyle.\n- Shadows Wake Me was released in 1996 on the indie label Latitude Records and was later released by EMI Music Canada.\n- Ken Myhr produced Shadows Wake Me.\n- Before producing Shadows Wake Me, Ken Myhr had worked with Jane Siberry and Cowboy Junkies.\n- Cowboy Junkies are a Canadian alternative country, blues, and folk rock band.",
